        "english_name": "English",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Lok, a 34-year-old filmmaker from Macau, has been drifting through Hong Kong’s film industry. Although she has already directed a feature film, her life remains unstable, her next project has stalled, and her girlfriend Bei Bei is pushing for them to get married, buy a house, and settle down. Facing multiple pressures, Lok revisits different moments in her past: when she was studying in Taiwan aged 22, and when she was growing up in Macau aged 17.",
          "runtime": 100,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "Girlfriends"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "TW",
        "iso_639_1": "zh",
        "name": "普通话",
        "english_name": "Mandarin",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "17岁的欣，身处去哪都不超过三十分钟的澳门。她的生活平凡，直到遇见学姐菲才开始思考自己是否可以过更多姿多彩的生活。22岁时，她在台湾就读新闻系，与女友晴同居，但毕业季的波澜让她陷入困境，无法决定未来。34岁的欣在香港打拼，试图摆脱“一片导演”的魔咒，亦面对来自适婚女友贝的压力。最终在贝的假结婚狂想中，欣领悟到做自己是最佳的生存之道。",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "女孩不平凡"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "HK",
        "iso_639_1": "zh",
        "name": "普通话",
        "english_name": "Mandarin",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "17 歲的欣，身處去哪都不超過三十分鐘的澳門。她的生活平凡，直到遇見學姐菲才開始思考自己是否可以過更多姿多彩的生活。22 歲時，她在台灣就讀新聞系，與女友晴同居，但畢業季的波瀾讓她陷入困境，無法決定未來。34 歲的欣在香港打拼，試圖擺脱「一片導演」的魔咒，亦面對來自適婚女友貝的壓力。最終在貝的假結婚狂想中，欣領悟到做自己是最佳的生存之道。",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "女孩不平凡"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "KR",
        "iso_639_1": "ko",
        "name": "한국어/조선말",
        "english_name": "Korean",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "마카오에서 자라 대만에서 대학시절을 보낸 록은 현재 홍콩에서 자신의 두 번째 영화를 연출할 기회를 기다린다. 그녀의 파트너 베이 베이는 안정적인 삶을 원하고, 갈등하던 록은 자신의 과거로 여행을 떠난다.",
          "runtime": 101,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "걸프렌드"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "SG",
        "iso_639_1": "zh",
        "name": "普通话",
        "english_name": "Mandarin",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "三个时代、三个城市、三段恋情，温柔回溯一个平凡女孩习爱的不凡旅程。17岁时的青春懵懂，22岁时的不够勇敢，34岁时经过现实打磨的蜕变成长。",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "NL",
        "iso_639_1": "nl",
        "name": "Nederlands",
        "english_name": "Dutch",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "De dertigjarige Lok is een filmmaker die moeite heeft haar carrière in Hongkong overeind te houden, terwijl haar vriendin verlangt naar stabiliteit. Onder de druk en creatieve uitputting raakt Lok opnieuw verscheurd tussen het uitzonderlijke leven waar ze van droomt en de realiteit waarin ze vastzit. Ontgoocheld keert ze terug naar eerdere versies van zichzelf — elk met een eigen partner, spanningen en verlangens die nooit zijn ingelost.\r Verteld in omgekeerde volgorde volgt de film Lok van haar rusteloze twintiger jaren als pas afgestudeerde in Taiwan, terug naar haar open, zoekende tienertijd in Macau, waar ze wordt geconfronteerd met studiekeuzes en de eerste contouren van haar identiteit. In deze gefragmenteerde terugblik probeert Lok te begrijpen wie ze is geworden.",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "Girlfriends"
        }
      },
